<title>HUNGARY: Hungary O/N rates unchanged at 20.875/21.00.</title>
<headline>Hungary O/N rates unchanged at 20.875/21.00.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian overnight rates remained unchanged for a second day on Tuesday amid minimal demand.</p>
<p>Overnight rates opened and ended at 20.875/21.00 percent, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There were no large demands,&quot; said Erika Kaiser of Budapest Bank. &quot;Everything is very quiet.&quot;</p>
<p>	 -- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
